cff-version: 1.2.0
message: "If you use OpenSML-150M code, tokenizer, or documented research, please cite this repository."
type: software
title: "OpenSML-150M: Small Language Model Research with Native MLX"
authors:
  - family-names: Zebrowski
    given-names: William
repository-code: "https://github.com/williamzebrowskI/opensml-150m"
url: "https://github.com/williamzebrowskI/opensml-150m"
abstract: >-
  A 150.44M-parameter language-model research project on Apple Silicon,
  including byte-level BPE tokenizer training, Stage A/B pretraining,
  three supervised fine-tuning stages, native MLX code, recorded benchmark
  results, and technical documentation. Model weights are not included
  in this source repository.
keywords:
  - small language models
  - MLX
  - Apple Silicon
  - pretraining
  - supervised fine-tuning
  - evaluation
license: Apache-2.0
